WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.887
Borsuk fails in dimension nine.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.751
The lowest known failure was dimension sixty three.

3
00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:08.333
Now: lines through the origin of four-space.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.978
Ten smaller pieces would force a labelling

5
00:00:10.978 --> 00:00:13.056
pattern, and a checked search finds none.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.625
Claimed: Borsuk fails from dimension nine.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.016
Main theorem in Lean.
